wme32 proc_mode' addr_size eff_addr base_reg seg_reg data' check_alignment? mem_ptr? =
  store_bytes_to_ea proc_mode' addr_size (zpos #4) eff_addr base_reg seg_reg data' check_alignment? mem_ptr?
